DESCRIPTION:About the classOn the first and third Saturday of each month w
 e offer artists the opportunity to work uninstructed from a nude model in 
 a relaxed and welcoming atmosphere. The session begins with two-minute ges
 ture poses\, followed by 5-minute\, 10-minute\, and 20-minute poses\, conc
 luding with a one-hour pose. The model takes a break every twenty minutes.
  Easels\, tables\, and art boards are provided. Bring your own art supplie
 s\; all two-dimensional media are allowed\, provided there is no odor. Age
  1
